<title>SINGAPORE: Datapulse half-yr profits up sharply.</title>
<headline>Datapulse half-yr profits up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31 1997</p>
<p>	     (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     1.51	 vs     0.29</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)    0.84	 vs     0.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		14.23	 vs    13.41</p>
<p>    Other income	   1.04	 vs     0.63</p>
<p>    Interest expense     0.29	 vs     0.31</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax    1.51	 vs     0.38</p>
<p>    Tax			nil	  vs     0.09</p>
<p>Note - Datapulse Technology Ltd said the three-fold increase in operating profit was due to increased proportion of compact disc sales with higher margin.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
